SQL> --3] WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY NAME OF THE EMPLOYEE AND MANAGERS SALARY IF EMPLOYEE AND MANAGER BOTH EARN MORE THEN 2000 ?
SQL> 
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT E1.ENAME, E2.SAL
  2  FROM EMP E1, EMP E2
  3  WHERE E1.MGR= E2.EMPNO AND E1.SAL >2000 AND E2.SAL>2000 ;

