SQL> --5] WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY EMPLOYEE NAME AND MANAGERS HIREDATE IF EMPLOYEE WAS HIRED BEFORE 1982 ?
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT E1.ENAME , E2.HIREDATE
  2  FROM EMP E1, EMP E2
  3  WHERE E1.MGR= E2.EMPNO AND E1.HIREDATE < '01-JAN-1982';

