SQL> --6] WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY EMPLOYEE NAME  AND MANAGER NAME AND THEIR SALARY IF EMPLOYEE EARNS MORE THAN MANAGER ?
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT E1.ENAME, E2. ENAME
  2  , E2. SAL, E1.SAL
  3  FROM EMP E1, EMP E2
  4  WHERE E1.MGR= E2.EMPNO AND E1.SAL > E2.SAL;

