SQL> --10] WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY EMPLOYEE NAME AND MANAGER NAME ALONG WITH THEIR ANNUAL SALARY IF EMPLOYEE WORKS IN DEPTNO 10, 20 AND MANAGER, SALARY IS GREATER THAN EMPLOYEE SALARY ?
SQL> 
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT E1.ENAME , E1.SAL*12 , E2.ENAME, E2.SAL*12
  2  FROM EMP E1, EMP E2
  3  WHERE E1.MGR = E2.EMPNO AND E1.DEPTNO IN (10,20) AND E2.SAL >E1.SAL;

ENAME       E1.SAL*12 ENAME       E2.SAL*12                                                         
